{
  "id": "npc_courier",
  "title": "托NPC按真实路线送货到固定交接点",
  "requirements": [
    "N5"
  ],
  "initial": {
    "mode": "new"
  },
  "turns": [
    {
      "input": "我走进青灯酒馆找林穗。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_qingdeng"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）先核对林穗目前是否确有面包库存。只查询，不买、不送，不推进时间。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_read"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.inventory"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我确认愿意付两铜买一份现有面包，请林穗今天上午十一点送到村务屋当面交给我，到时我同时付她两铜。我先去那里等。请她明确同意后登记她的送货约定和我的两铜付款约定，两份都在今天十一点履行；现在不交货、不付款，也不加入同行队伍。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_promise"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "送货",
            "promisor": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "promisee": "player",
            "deliveryVersion": 1,
            "location": "bld_hw_council",
            "deadline": 660,
            "item": "item_bread",
            "quantity": 1
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.player.companions",
          "value": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "付款",
            "promisor": "player",
            "promisee": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "coins": 2,
            "deadline": 660
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我仍留在酒馆原地等一分钟，让林穗自行开始送货，不与她同行，也不提前收面包。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "送货",
            "promisor": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "status": "进行中"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我自己去村务屋等她，不带路、不召唤，也不让她改变交接地点。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_move"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_council"
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在村务屋原地等到今天上午十一点，期间不做别的事。到时依刚才的两份约定当面收一份面包、付两铜，只各执行一次。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.minute",
          "value": 660
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "送货",
            "promisor": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "deliveryVersion": 1,
            "status": "已完成",
            "resolvedAt": 660
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "equals",
          "path": "state.npcs.npc_hw_linsui.location",
          "value": "bld_hw_council"
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 1
        },
        {
          "kind": "delta",
          "path": "state.player.coins",
          "value": -2
        },
        {
          "kind": "records",
          "path": "state.obligations",
          "where": {
            "type": "付款",
            "promisor": "player",
            "promisee": "npc_hw_linsui",
            "status": "已完成"
          },
          "min": 1,
          "max": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "（场外）只核对一次这份送货约定的完成状态和我手里的面包数量，不再收货、交易或推进时间。",
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins",
            "state.obligations"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "input": "我在村务屋再等五分钟，不再次收货，不交易，也不找人聊天。",
      "expectedTools": [
        "world_time"
      ],
      "assertions": [
        {
          "kind": "elapsed",
          "min": 5,
          "max": 5
        },
        {
          "kind": "unchanged",
          "paths": [
            "state.inventory",
            "state.player.coins"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "quantity",
          "path": "state.inventory.item_bread",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rubric": {
    "truth": "真实路线、库存与义务回执为准；未登记、被拒、未到场不能叙述成交付成功。",
    "agency": "不得擅自交易、复制面包、用同行或瞬移代替独立送货，不更改固定交接地点。",
    "language": "简体中文，不暴露工具或内部编号。",
    "continuity": "N5成功分支：送货者亲自履约，交付只发生一次；失败时保留具体原因，不伪造成功。此脚本的成功断言不会因解释失败原因而放宽。"
  }
}
